{"id":"1.0","doc":"T","title":"Overview (from the chip datasheet)","words":203,"blocks":[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":1,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"ESP32-S3 has a low-power Xtensa® dual-core "},{"t":"num","v":"32-bit","k":"size"},{"t":"text","v":" LX7 microprocessor."}]},{"n":2,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"(Facts below come from the ESP32-S3 Series Datasheet, sections 4.1.1.1 CPU and 4.1.1.2 PIE."}]},{"n":3,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"The PIE overview, features and structure are in "},{"t":"xref","id":"1.1","c":[{"t":"text","v":"§1.1"}]},{"t":"text","v":" to "},{"t":"xref","id":"1.3","c":[{"t":"text","v":"§1.3"}]},{"t":"text","v":".)"}]}]},{"t":"p","s":[{"n":4,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"CPU feature list:"}]}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":5,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Five-stage pipeline that supports the clock frequency of up to "},{"t":"num","v":"240 MHz","k":"frequency"},{"t":"text","v":" (pipeline stages: "},{"t":"xref","id":"1.7","c":[{"t":"text","v":"§1.7"}]},{"t":"text","v":")"}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":6,"c":[{"t":"num","v":"16-bit","k":"size"},{"t":"text","v":"/"},{"t":"num","v":"24-bit","k":"size"},{"t":"text","v":" instruction set providing high code density"}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":7,"c":[{"t":"num","v":"32-bit","k":"size"},{"t":"text","v":" customized instruction set and "},{"t":"num","v":"128-bit","k":"size"},{"t":"text","v":" data bus that provide high computing performance"}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":8,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Support for single-precision floating-point unit (FPU)"}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":9,"c":[{"t":"num","v":"32-bit","k":"size"},{"t":"text","v":" multiplier and "},{"t":"num","v":"32-bit","k":"size"},{"t":"text","v":" divider"}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":10,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Unbuffered GPIO instructions (see "},{"t":"xref","id":"1.5.2","c":[{"t":"text","v":"§1.5.2"}]},{"t":"text","v":")"}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":11,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"32 interrupts at six levels"}]}]}],[{"t":"p","s":[{"n":12,"c":[{"t":"text","v":"Windowed ABI with 64 physi